sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant TDD as 🎭 TDD Orchestrator
    participant Test as 🧪 Test Runner
    participant Code as 💻 Code Analyzer
    participant Quality as 📊 Quality Scorer
    participant Git as 🔗 Git Checkpoint
    
    %% Initialization
    User->>TDD: start tdd [feature]
    activate TDD
    TDD->>TDD: Initialize phases<br/>(RED, GREEN, REFACTOR)
    TDD->>Git: Create baseline checkpoint
    Git-->>TDD: ✅ Checkpoint created
    
    %% RED PHASE
    rect rgb(231, 76, 60)
        Note over TDD: 🔴 RED PHASE: Write Failing Tests
        TDD->>TDD: 🎭 Phase transition: INIT → RED
        TDD->>Test: Generate test scaffolds
        Test->>Test: Create test files<br/>(test_*.py)
        Test-->>TDD: ✅ Test files created
        
        TDD->>User: 📝 Review generated tests
        User->>User: Customize tests<br/>(edge cases, validations)
        User->>TDD: Tests ready
        
        TDD->>Test: Run test suite
        activate Test
        Test->>Test: pytest tests/ -v
        Test-->>TDD: ❌ ALL TESTS MUST FAIL
        deactivate Test
        
        alt Tests Pass (INVALID)
            Test-->>TDD: ❌ Tests passing (invalid RED phase)
            TDD->>TDD: SKULL: RED_PHASE_VALIDATION
            TDD->>User: ⚠️ RED phase violation:<br/>Tests must fail first!
            TDD->>TDD: Rollback to checkpoint
        else Tests Fail (VALID)
            Test-->>TDD: ✅ Tests failing as expected
            TDD->>Git: Create RED phase checkpoint
            Git-->>TDD: ✅ RED checkpoint saved
        end
    end
    
    %% GREEN PHASE
    rect rgb(80, 200, 120)
        Note over TDD: 🟢 GREEN PHASE: Minimal Implementation
        TDD->>TDD: 🎭 Phase transition: RED → GREEN
        TDD->>User: 💻 Implement minimal code
        User->>User: Write code to pass tests<br/>(minimal viable implementation)
        User->>TDD: Implementation complete
        
        loop Until All Tests Pass
            TDD->>Test: Run test suite
            activate Test
            Test->>Test: pytest tests/ -v
            Test-->>TDD: Test results
            deactivate Test
            
            alt Tests Still Failing
                TDD->>User: ❌ {N} tests failing<br/>Fix implementation
                User->>User: Debug and fix code
                User->>TDD: Try again
            else All Tests Passing
                TDD->>TDD: ✅ GREEN phase complete
                TDD->>Git: Create GREEN phase checkpoint
                Git-->>TDD: ✅ GREEN checkpoint saved
            end
        end
    end
    
    %% REFACTOR PHASE
    rect rgb(123, 104, 238)
        Note over TDD: 🔵 REFACTOR PHASE: Clean Code
        TDD->>TDD: 🎭 Phase transition: GREEN → REFACTOR
        TDD->>Code: Analyze code quality
        activate Code
        Code->>Code: Check SOLID principles
        Code->>Code: Check DRY violations
        Code->>Code: Check KISS/YAGNI
        Code->>Code: Measure complexity (McCabe)
        Code-->>TDD: Analysis complete
        deactivate Code
        
        TDD->>Quality: Score code (0-10 scale)
        activate Quality
        Quality->>Quality: Evaluate:<br/>• Readability (0-10)<br/>• Maintainability (0-10)<br/>• Complexity (0-10)<br/>• Test Coverage (0-10)
        Quality-->>TDD: Score: {X}/10
        deactivate Quality
        
        alt Score < 7 (Needs Refactoring)
            TDD->>User: ⚠️ Score: {X}/10<br/>Refactor recommended
            TDD->>TDD: Generate refactoring suggestions:<br/>• Simplify complex functions<br/>• Extract methods<br/>• Remove duplication<br/>• Improve naming
            TDD->>User: 📋 Apply suggestions?
            User->>User: Refactor code
            User->>TDD: Refactoring complete
            
            TDD->>Test: Verify tests still pass
            activate Test
            Test-->>TDD: ✅ All tests passing
            deactivate Test
            
            TDD->>Code: Re-analyze quality
            Code-->>TDD: New analysis
            TDD->>Quality: Re-score
            Quality-->>TDD: New score: {Y}/10
        else Score >= 7 (Acceptable)
            TDD->>TDD: ✅ Code quality acceptable
        end
        
        TDD->>Git: Create REFACTOR checkpoint
        Git-->>TDD: ✅ Final checkpoint saved
    end
    
    %% Completion
    TDD->>TDD: 🎭 Orchestrator completing:<br/>✅ ALL WORK COMPLETE
    TDD->>User: 🎉 TDD Cycle Complete!<br/>• All tests passing ✅<br/>• Code quality: {Y}/10<br/>• Checkpoints: 4 created
    deactivate TDD
    
    %% Alternative: Rollback
    Note over TDD,Git: Rollback Available at Any Phase:<br/>tdd rollback [checkpoint_id]
